meta {
  name: Invitation imports - Rows
  type: http
  seq: 216
}

get {
  url: {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/communities/nswswk8w8wso0ko8owwk8k0w/invitation-imports/<cuid of an import>/rows?outcome=refused&limit=50&offset=0
  body: none
  auth: none
}

params:query {
  outcome: refused
  limit: 50
  offset: 0
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

docs {
  The rows of an import by their number in the file (#1390): email, role, access_groups and member_tags (the names), outcome, reason, reason_text, detail, still_invited, sent_at. outcome keeps one result or several, comma separated (valid, refused, queued, sent, held, failed, skipped). limit 10 by default, 1000 at most. The rows hold the email addresses of people who are not members. Token ability: invitations:read.
}
